                <pb facs="0585" n="491" sameAs="frus:frus1924v02/pg491"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/3052: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Ramer</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-04-01T16:00:00-05:45"><hi rendition="#italic">April 1, 1924—4
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 11:45 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>57. Department’s 34 March 28, 4 p.m. President Martinez agrees to retain one of
                    Dodds’ assistants throughout electoral period.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ramer</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
